; Room script 16: Lake of despair
;
; Op $96 turns an area into free space (flag $80). Op $9D animates a strip of liquid at the bottom row of the room:
; row 21, from column 6, 16 cells wide, attribute $13 (#R$AD88).
; .
; Room 16: column 1, row 3 of the 5x5 map (left is room 15, right 17, up 11, down 21, counted modulo 25). Subscripts:
; #R$82F0, #R$7955, #R$7A2B. Items (#R$8EDF) at row,column: parchment 5,22, cross 6,2.
@label=RoomScript16
b$7C8F DEFB $87,$10         ; ROOMNAME 16 "Lake of despair"
 $7C91 DEFB $83 ; CALL ScriptRoomPanel
@isub=DEFW ScriptRoomPanel
 $7C92 DEFW $82F0
